</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/aa4f9328-5417-11f1-92f3-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-05-20T042811Z-1063367069-RC2SCLAIM198-RTRMADP-3-CHINA-RUSSIA.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/aa4f9328-5417-11f1-92f3-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-05-20T042811Z-1063367069-RC2SCLAIM198-RTRMADP-3-CHINA-RUSSIA.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">12d01274-a3c3-11f1-b511-6de5879846fd</guid><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 16:30:05 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/aa4f9328-5417-11f1-92f3-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-05-20T042811Z-1063367069-RC2SCLAIM198-RTRMADP-3-CHINA-RUSSIA.jpg">© Maxim Stulov / REUTERS</source><dc:creator>古莉</dc:creator></item><item><category>国际</category><title>俄罗斯对基辅附近一处弹药库发动空袭，造成至少37人死亡</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E5%9B%BD%E9%99%85/20260829-%E4%BF%84%E7%BD%97%E6%96%AF%E5%AF%B9%E5%9F%BA%E8%BE%85%E9%99%84%E8%BF%91%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%84%E5%BC%B9%E8%8D%AF%E5%BA%93%E5%8F%91%E5%8A%A8%E7%A9%BA%E8%A2%AD%EF%BC%8C%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E8%87%B3%E5%B0%9137%E4%BA%BA%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1</link><description>
